First release.

Drag to aim, release to drop. Two orbs of the same tier that touch fuse into the next one up — and a fusion can set off the ones underneath it.

Only the five smallest tiers are ever dealt, so every big orb is one you built. A single drop that sets off four fusions scores far more than four separate ones.

Every 18 fusions the well SURGES and everything jolts, which usually starts a cascade.

Let the well overflow and it's done.
